{
 "$comment": "Hand-written interactions of the governance-designer flow, applied by assemble.cjs. Per state -> controls. Control: kind button (kit Button, by text or aria-label) | action (action object of a kit, e.g. Dialog.Footer primaryAction, by its label) | close (Dialog.Header X) | radios (RadioGroup holding an option with this value); scope page | dialog. Behaviour: go <state> | go {ifFilled, else (null = stay), fields} | go {byRadio {value: state}} | onPick {value: state} (radios) | selectable (radios: let the choice change, read by a byRadio). Targets are state ids; navigation = hidden anchor clicked from the handler (mechanism B).",
 "GD_1_01_step1-empty": [
  { "kind": "button", "label": "Next", "scope": "page", "go": { "ifFilled": "GD_1_03_designer-basic-empty", "else": "GD_4_01_step1-errors", "fields": ["Process name", "Key"] } }
 ],
